@@ PE4 | Predictive
Investors want monthly financial reports, while future tenants want to give input on the design. What should the stakeholder engagement plan do?
A) Tailor the methods and frequency of engagement to each group
B) Give every group the same monthly financial report for consistency
C) Engage only the investors, since they fund the development project
D) Engage only the tenants, since they will use the building every day
