@@ PE4 | Hybrid | multi
Which two actions help identify stakeholders who are not obvious? (Choose two.)
A) Asking known stakeholders who else is affected
B) Reviewing the registers of similar past projects
C) Listing only the people named in the charter
D) Waiting until people complain about the project
E) Limiting the list to the organisation's own staff
